  "body": "New offline integration batch task3 PREPARATION ONLY. Contract PR166/054aba88 and completion handoverdfa1d59 passed full publication/readback BEFORE this runner. Original SQL catalog batch remains COMPLETE; no repeated batch.\n\nFIRST consuming runnerfd5aa54f451c58e0a565030d8bb0800bf418bf92/treee4e6d509995ab9a5c6b12e7b98822fa59c150bfa/sole parentdfa1d59c3c7d40e2992d1dec6e070e994d893bc5. All6complete changed files/ref/tree/parent/human metadata read back. Preserved26literal future cases are consumed through strict full-table metadata/health/rows/error equality, input snapshots and repeated output mutation/ownership. Two real DB/MI one-GET smoke cases use existing constructors and freeze exact URL/1MiB/count/full output. BOTH ProjectSQLCapabilityTable and CollectSQLCapabilityTable are ABSENT. Static workflow/gate/handoff and whitespace checks passed; runtime compilation EXPECTED TO FAIL.\n\nInspect BOTH actual Linux AND Windows native missing report APIs BEFORE ANY report production edit. Preserve this first runner and oracleab90d0ea/budgetb9c73840 plus all old316cases/first runners/primaries/modules/pins/captures. Missing-API compilation failure is preparation, not product regression/pass or runtime coverage. No API stubs/implementation exist.\n\nAfter both observations, implement bounded internal report projection/wrapper with prevalidation/snapshots/oneGET, all-input validation,8MiB output boundary, canonical full coordinates/authoritative metadata/modes, explicit unknown health, owned deterministic data and fixed Project22/Collect57 late contexts. Then independent compiler reversals/named failures/exact restoration, actual HTTP/renderer/redaction/result-scope tests and coherent atomic implementation+runner rollback to verified contract tree63545e0c/restoration. Own final8workers/bothgates/source/full logs/all533Linux/528Windows prior identities+newcontrols/23captures/archive/full readback/final handover remain mandatory.\n\nNo public registry/scoring/deployment eligibility/schema changes. Bind each diagnostic result to one canonical subscription/region; SARIF primary findings only, JSON/tabular diagnostics carry health. No current critical input or Azure access. No Azure/fixture/RBAC/refresh/subagents/protected merge/bypass/release. Prior heads/unrelated work preserved; independent review/backup/operational/live/security/license/Gate004/release/advisory remain open.\n\n## BOTH native missing APIs inspected BEFORE production\n\nQuality39160871908: Windows-native117773714360 complete33084bytes/SHA2565af355de42251f0759cac79c06515c57fc9d3341adb79c6ebdd89eb6ad74a33f and Linux-native117773714247 complete47610bytes/SHA256fd852bcb24f05e85bc26d496b22d79a281e440b7c4a1f3a19b0ae58d91516949 both show undefined ProjectSQLCapabilityTable AND CollectSQLCapabilityTable, no syntax/unrelated compile errors. Actual log timestamps2026-10-18T19:55:50Z/19:56:54Z. Complete10preparation logs/run/jobs retained; both gates correctly failed. Observation proof written2026-10-18T19:59:34.595Z while implementation worktree clean and report production file ABSENT. This is missing-API preparation, not product regression/runtime coverage/pass. Authorized report production may now proceed, preserving first runner/frozen oracles; own final QA/rollback/evidence remains mandatory.\n\n## Recoverable report WIP successor and isolated renderer defect\n\nContinue at draft PR168 https://github.com/DeBoX85/Cloud-Assess/pull/168, code57af1f647aa2e5f24bc5f45d1ef24b2a5d3010dc/tree0a554ebc3ae07a36c8e98a73d48332388120b05f/parent first runnerfd5aa54f. All10complete files/ref/tree/parent/human metadata/PR read back. ALL26runtime cases and independent report bounds/context/HTTP/ownership pass locally after both missing APIs observed. Actual file tests expose preexisting Assessment Status ScopeID masking defect QA-INT-04; renderer production unchanged. Both native named regression observations required before its narrow correction. Keep correction separately verified for safe report rollback. WIP is intentionally unverified/red, not product certification; first runner/oracles/pins/captures remain preserved.",
